jsonb_build_object('number',17,'question',E'다음 (A), (B)에 들어갈 말로 가장 적절한 것을 고르시오.\n\nIf school (A)__________ early today, I (B)__________ to the movies.','type','mcq','options',jsonb_build_array(E'finish — will go',E'finishes — go',E'will finish — will go',E'finishes — will go',E'will finish — go'),'answer',E'4','explanation',E'if절 3인칭 단수 현재(finishes) + 주절 will(will go)'),
jsonb_build_object('number',18,'question',E'다음 빈칸에 들어갈 말로 가장 적절한 것을 고르시오.\n\n______ the weather (A)______ fine tomorrow, I (B)______ hiking with friends.','type','mcq','options',jsonb_build_array(E'If — is — will go',E'If — will be — go',E'If — is — go',E'Unless — is — won''t go',E'If — was — will go'),'answer',E'1','explanation',E'If + 현재시제(is) + 주절 will(will go)'),
