jsonb_build_object('number',24,'question',E'다음 중 어법상 옳은 문장을 고르시오.\n\n① Water boils if the temperature reaches 100℃.\n② I will stay home if it will rain tomorrow.\n③ If you will need money, I''ll lend you some.\n④ If Minjun leave now, she won''t be late.\n⑤ I always get hungry if I will skip breakfast.','type','mcq','options',jsonb_build_array(E'①',E'②',E'③',E'④',E'⑤'),'answer',E'1','explanation',E'① 일반적 사실/과학적 진리 — 현재시제+현재시제 올바름'),
jsonb_build_object('number',25,'question',E'다음 중 어법상 옳은 문장을 고르시오.\n\n① I can''t tell if it rains tomorrow.\n② I''ll go to the beach if I have some free time.\n③ Do you know if he comes tomorrow?\n④ We don''t know if he comes to the party or not.\n⑤ I''ll play soccer if it will be sunny.','type','mcq','options',jsonb_build_array(E'①',E'②',E'③',E'④',E'⑤'),'answer',E'2','explanation',E'② 조건절 if + 현재시제(have) + 주절 will 올바름. ①③④ 명사절 if에서 미래는 will 필요, ⑤ if절에 will 불가')
