jsonb_build_object('number',39,'question',E'다음 중 어법상 <u>어색한</u> 문장을 고르시오.\n\n① If you eat tomatoes every day, you will become healthy.\n② If I finish the homework, I''ll play baseball.\n③ If you think that way, you won''t have to worry.\n④ If the weather is nice on Saturday, I''ll go on a picnic.\n⑤ Yujin will read a book at home if her school will finish early today.','type','mcq','options',jsonb_build_array(E'①',E'②',E'③',E'④',E'⑤'),'answer',E'5','explanation',E'⑤ if절에 will 불가 → finishes'),
jsonb_build_object('number',40,'question',E'다음 중 어법상 <u>어색한</u> 문장을 고르시오.\n\n① If it will rain tomorrow, I will stay home.\n② If he is late, he won''t play baseball.\n③ If we take the bus, it will be cheaper.\n④ If you save money, you can buy a new computer.\n⑤ Unless you take some water, you will feel very thirsty.','type','mcq','options',jsonb_build_array(E'①',E'②',E'③',E'④',E'⑤'),'answer',E'1','explanation',E'① if절에 will 불가 → rains'),
jsonb_build_object('number',41,'question',E'다음 우리말을 영어로 바르게 옮긴 것을 고르시오.\n\n만약 내가 그 책을 다 읽으면 너에게 빌려줄게.\n\n① If I finish the book, I''ll lend it to you.\n② If I will finish the book, I''ll lend it to you.\n③ If I finish the book, I lend it to you.\n④ Unless I finish the book, I''ll lend it to you.\n⑤ If I finished the book, I''ll lend it to you.','type','mcq','options',jsonb_build_array(E'①',E'②',E'③',E'④',E'⑤'),'answer',E'1','explanation',E'if절 현재(finish)+주절 will(I''ll lend) 올바름'),
jsonb_build_object('number',42,'question',E'다음 우리말을 영어로 바르게 옮긴 것을 고르시오.\n\n만약 네가 지금 떠나지 않는다면 너는 늦을 것이다.\n\n① If you won''t leave now, you''ll be late.\n② If you will not leave now, you''ll be late.\n③ If you don''t leave now, you''ll be late.\n④ Unless you leave now, you will not be late.\n⑤ If you not leave now, you''ll be late.','type','mcq','options',jsonb_build_array(E'①',E'②',E'③',E'④',E'⑤'),'answer',E'3','explanation',E'if절 현재부정(don''t leave) 올바름. ①② if절에 will 불가 ④ 의미 다름 ⑤ 문법 오류'),
jsonb_build_object('number',43,'question',E'다음 우리말을 영어로 바르게 옮긴 것을 고르시오.\n\n만약 내일 눈이 내린다면, 나는 집에 머무를 것이다.\n\n① If it snow tomorrow, I''ll stay at home.\n② If it will snow tomorrow, I''ll stay at home.\n③ If it snows tomorrow, I''ll stay at home.\n④ Unless it snows tomorrow, I''ll stay at home.\n⑤ If it snowed tomorrow, I''ll stay at home.','type','mcq','options',jsonb_build_array(E'①',E'②',E'③',E'④',E'⑤'),'answer',E'3','explanation',E'if절 3인칭 단수 현재(snows) 올바름'),
jsonb_build_object('number',44,'question',E'다음 우리말을 영어로 바르게 옮긴 것을 고르시오.\n\n네가 원하면 나는 너를 도울 수 있어.\n\n① I help you if you want.\n② I can help you if you will want.\n③ I will help you if you can want.\n④ I can help you if you want.\n⑤ I will help you if you will want.','type','mcq','options',jsonb_build_array(E'①',E'②',E'③',E'④',E'⑤'),'answer',E'4','explanation',E'조건절 현재(want)+주절 can 올바름'),
jsonb_build_object('number',45,'question',E'다음 우리말을 영어로 바르게 옮긴 것을 고르시오.\n\n만약 더 빨리 걷지 않는다면, 너는 늦을 것이다.\n\n① If you walk faster, you will be late.\n② Unless you walk faster, you will be late.\n③ Unless you walk faster, you won''t be late.\n④ If you don''t walk faster, you won''t be late.\n⑤ Unless you will walk faster, you will be late.','type','mcq','options',jsonb_build_array(E'①',E'②',E'③',E'④',E'⑤'),'answer',E'2','explanation',E'Unless = If not, 더 빨리 걷지 않으면 늦을 것'),
jsonb_build_object('number',46,'question',E'다음 우리말을 영어로 바르게 옮긴 것을 고르시오.\n\n만약 내일 비가 오지 않는다면, 우리는 소풍을 갈 것이다.\n\n① If it do not rain tomorrow, we will go on a picnic.\n② If it will not rain tomorrow, we will go on a picnic.\n③ If it does not rain tomorrow, we will go on a picnic.\n④ We go on a picnic if it do not rain tomorrow.\n⑤ We go on a picnic if it will not rain tomorrow.','type','mcq','options',jsonb_build_array(E'①',E'②',E'③',E'④',E'⑤'),'answer',E'3','explanation',E'3인칭 단수 부정 does not rain 올바름'),
jsonb_build_object('number',47,'question',E'다음 우리말을 영어로 바르게 옮긴 것을 고르시오.\n\n만약 그가 아침을 먹지 않는다면, 그는 수업 중에 배가 고플 것이다.\n\n① He is hungry if he doesn''t eat breakfast.\n② He will hungry if he doesn''t eat breakfast.\n③ He will be hungry if he will not eat breakfast.\n④ He will be hungry if he doesn''t eat breakfast.\n⑤ He will be hungry unless he eats breakfast.','type','mcq','options',jsonb_build_array(E'①',E'②',E'③',E'④',E'⑤'),'answer',E'4','explanation',E'if절 현재부정(doesn''t eat)+주절 will be 올바름. ⑤도 의미상 맞지만 우리말이 "먹지 않는다면"이므로 if + 부정이 직역에 더 적합'),
jsonb_build_object('number',48,'question',E'다음 우리말을 영어로 바르게 옮긴 것을 고르시오.\n\n나에게 5달러를 빌려주면, 내일 너에게 갚을게.\n\n① If you lend me five dollars, I will pay you back tomorrow.\n② If you will lend me five dollars, I will pay you back tomorrow.\n③ Unless you lend me five dollars, I will pay you back tomorrow.\n④ If you lend me five dollars, I pay you back tomorrow.\n⑤ If you lended me five dollars, I will pay you back tomorrow.','type','mcq','options',jsonb_build_array(E'①',E'②',E'③',E'④',E'⑤'),'answer',E'1','explanation',E'if절 현재(lend)+주절 will 올바름. ② will lend 불가 ③ 의미 다름 ④ 주절 will 필요 ⑤ lended→lent(과거형 오류)')
