jsonb_build_object('number',49,'question',E'다음 중 밑줄 친 if의 쓰임이 나머지 넷과 다른 하나를 고르시오.\n\n① I will bring some books <u>if</u> I visit my parents.\n② <u>If</u> you don''t run, you''ll be late for school.\n③ I''d like to go with you <u>if</u> you don''t mind.\n④ <u>If</u> I pay for the ticket, will you go with me?\n⑤ I don''t know <u>if</u> he wants to go to the zoo.','type','mcq','options',jsonb_build_array(E'①',E'②',E'③',E'④',E'⑤'),'answer',E'5','explanation',E'⑤ 명사절 (~인지 아닌지, know의 목적어) / 나머지 조건 부사절'),
