jsonb_build_object('number',51,'question',E'다음 중 밑줄 친 if의 쓰임이 나머지 넷과 다른 하나를 고르시오.\n\n① <u>If</u> you take a taxi, you won''t be late.\n② I will go swimming <u>if</u> it is fine tomorrow.\n③ <u>If</u> you fly higher, you can see more.\n④ <u>If</u> you start now, you''ll be in time.\n⑤ I don''t know <u>if</u> she''ll come back here.','type','mcq','options',jsonb_build_array(E'①',E'②',E'③',E'④',E'⑤'),'answer',E'5','explanation',E'⑤ 명사절 (~인지 아닌지) / 나머지 조건 부사절'),
jsonb_build_object('number',52,'question',E'다음 중 밑줄 친 if의 쓰임이 나머지 넷과 다른 하나를 고르시오.\n\n① <u>If</u> I go shopping, I''ll buy some fruit.\n② She asked me <u>if</u> she could use my car.\n③ They will go to the sea <u>if</u> it is sunny tomorrow.\n④ You will become unhealthy <u>if</u> you don''t exercise.\n⑤ <u>If</u> you kill the dragon, you will get the dragon''s tear.','type','mcq','options',jsonb_build_array(E'①',E'②',E'③',E'④',E'⑤'),'answer',E'2','explanation',E'② 명사절 (~인지 아닌지, asked의 목적어) / 나머지 조건 부사절'),
jsonb_build_object('number',53,'question',E'다음 중 밑줄 친 if의 쓰임이 나머지 넷과 다른 하나를 고르시오.\n\n① I''m not sure <u>if</u> it will rain tomorrow.\n② Can you tell me <u>if</u> the test is on Friday?\n③ He wanted to know <u>if</u> she had a broken bone.\n④ Do you know <u>if</u> he will have dinner with us?\n⑤ I will go out <u>if</u> it is fine tomorrow.','type','mcq','options',jsonb_build_array(E'①',E'②',E'③',E'④',E'⑤'),'answer',E'5','explanation',E'⑤ 조건 부사절 (만약 ~한다면) / 나머지 명사절 (~인지 아닌지)'),
jsonb_build_object('number',54,'question',E'다음 중 밑줄 친 if의 쓰임이 나머지 넷과 다른 하나를 고르시오.\n\n① <u>If</u> it''s warm tomorrow, we''ll drive in the country.\n② I shall tell him <u>if</u> he comes.\n③ I''ll go <u>if</u> you do.\n④ Do you mind <u>if</u> I open the window?\n⑤ I asked her <u>if</u> she knew French.','type','mcq','options',jsonb_build_array(E'①',E'②',E'③',E'④',E'⑤'),'answer',E'5','explanation',E'⑤ 명사절 (~인지 아닌지, asked의 목적어) / 나머지 조건 부사절'),
jsonb_build_object('number',55,'question',E'다음 <보기>의 if와 쓰임이 같은 것을 고르시오.\n\n<보기> If you read many books, you''ll be wiser.\n\n① I will be happier <u>if</u> you join the party.\n② No one knows <u>if</u> she will break the record.\n③ She asked me <u>if</u> I liked spicy food.\n④ Do you know <u>if</u> he is coming?\n⑤ I''m not sure <u>if</u> it will snow tomorrow.','type','mcq','options',jsonb_build_array(E'①',E'②',E'③',E'④',E'⑤'),'answer',E'1','explanation',E'<보기>는 조건 부사절. ① 조건 부사절 (같음) / ②③④⑤ 명사절'),
jsonb_build_object('number',56,'question',E'다음 중 밑줄 친 if의 쓰임이 나머지 넷과 다른 하나를 고르시오.\n\n① I don''t know <u>if</u> he will come soon.\n② <u>If</u> it rains tomorrow, we will not go on a picnic.\n③ I don''t know <u>if</u> he will come.\n④ Do you know <u>if</u> he will have dinner with us?\n⑤ I''m not sure <u>if</u> the store is open on Sunday.','type','mcq','options',jsonb_build_array(E'①',E'②',E'③',E'④',E'⑤'),'answer',E'2','explanation',E'② 조건 부사절 (만약 ~한다면) / 나머지 명사절 (~인지 아닌지)'),
jsonb_build_object('number',57,'question',E'다음 두 문장의 의미가 같으면 ○, 다르면 ✕를 쓰시오.\n\nIf you don''t hurry, you will be late. = Unless you hurry, you will be late.','type','short_answer','answer',E'○','similar_answers',jsonb_build_array(E'O',E'o'),'explanation',E'If ~ not = Unless, 의미 동일'),
jsonb_build_object('number',58,'question',E'다음 두 문장의 의미가 같으면 ○, 다르면 ✕를 쓰시오.\n\nUnless it rains, we will go camping. = If it doesn''t rain, we will go camping.','type','short_answer','answer',E'○','similar_answers',jsonb_build_array(E'O',E'o'),'explanation',E'Unless = If ~ not, 의미 동일'),
