jsonb_build_object('number',66,'question',E'다음 중 어법상 옳은 문장의 총 개수를 고르시오.\n\nⓐ If you study hard, you passed the test.\nⓑ Unless she comes, I will be sad.\nⓒ If it snows tomorrow, school will be cancelled.\nⓓ I will call you if I will arrive.\nⓔ If you are tired, take a rest.','type','mcq','options',jsonb_build_array(E'1개',E'2개',E'3개',E'4개',E'5개'),'answer',E'3','explanation',E'ⓑ, ⓒ, ⓔ 옳음 (3개). ⓐ passed→will pass ⓓ will arrive→arrive'),
